41496::$$$message_0304_0000_0000$$$::"Two of the friendly trio,[br]Kane Himuro (Left) and Yukika Saegusa (Right).::
41497::$$$message_0304_0001_0000$$$::"They each have new poses and outfits, like tracksuits and personal clothes.[br]The tracksuit is the uniform of Homurahara High's track & field club."::
41498::$$$message_0304_0002_0000$$$::"Miss Himuro wears urban chic."::
41499::$$$message_0304_0003_0000$$$::"She's wearing a hime cut and a half Windsor knot. Good taste. [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01m(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01m(中)]I'm impressed. I secretly see her as a rival in fashion sense."::
41500::$$$message_0304_0004_0000$$$::"I have the character artist's comment about Saegusa.[lr]::
41501::$$$message_0304_0004_0001$$$::'Yukika's family is poor in the backstory,[br]so we gave her a very plain design. I'm fond of her.'"::
41502::$$$message_0304_0005_0000$$$::"Yup, got that right.[br]It's good to be poor. [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服02e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服02e(中)]As long as you have jewels."::
41503::$$$message_0304_0006_0000$$$::"Honestly, you... That's as wild a misunderstanding as the queen who told her people to eat cake."::
41504::$$$message_0304_0007_0000$$$::"Incidentally, they also said that 'the animator who loves Yukika was very critical of this.' There's no pleasing everyone."::�X